57 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 29 0 R
/T (The Fasanara Capital Global Diversified Alternative Debt Fund aims to create long-term returns \(6-8% annual target return in EUR, 8-10% in US Dollar\) with very low volatility. The Fund seeks to achieve its objective by primarily investing in trade receivables and digital invoices to be bought from SMEs in Europe, US, Canada, and Australia, with a core emphasis on Europe. The key feature to achieve such returns is to employ a multi-platform investment approach relying on the best country-specific counterparty to reach granularity and true diversification. )
/E (The Fasanara Capital Global Diversified Alternative Debt Fund aims to create long-term returns \(6-8% annual target return in EUR, 8-10% in US Dollar\) with very low volatility. The Fund seeks to achieve its objective by primarily investing in trade receivables and digital invoices to be bought from SMEs in Europe, US, Canada, and Australia, with a core emphasis on Europe. The key feature to achieve such returns is to employ a multi-platform investment approach relying on the best country-specific counterparty to reach granularity and true diversification. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [25]
>>
