/Title (Bloomberg Barclays US Corporate 1-3Y The Bloomberg Barclays US Corporate 1 3 Y Index measures the investment grade, fixed rate, taxable corporate bond market with 1-3 year maturities. It includes USD denominated securities publicly issued by US and non US industrial, utility and financial issuers.)
